# Line endings — repo declares the contract, machine does not decide.
# All text files stored as LF in the repo AND in the working copy,
# regardless of OS or local Git config. Prevents phantom diffs in
# cross-platform/cross-tooling workflows (Write tool writes LF;
# Git for Windows default core.autocrlf=true converts LF→CRLF on
# checkout, which would diverge from the Write tool's output and
# generate spurious diffs on subsequent edits).
* text=auto eol=lf
